   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mot tuberkulos i Baltikum</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tuberculosis in Baltic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Principbeslut att st&#xF6;dja den gemensamma nordiska insatsen mot tuberkulos i Baltikum. Detta &#xE4;r en andra implementeringsfas av detta program. Det svenska st&#xF6;det &#xE4;r totalt 13 016 000 SEK. Svensk part &#xE4;r svenska Hj&#xE4;rt-Lungfonden i samarbete med de nordiska motsvarigheterna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The nordic countries&apos; Heart and Lung Associations will assist in the development of National Tuberculosis Programmes in the Baltic States. This is the second, implementary, phase of this fairly extensive project. The Swedish contribution amounts to a maximum of 13 016 000 SEK.</narrative>
  </description>
